EXPERIMENT 4: TRAIN RESERVATION SYSTEM
1. AIM
To design and develop an Online Train Reservation System using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript to search for trains, enter passenger details, select travel class, calculate ticket fares, and confirm reservations.
2. ALGORITHM
1. Start the program.
2. Create a webpage for the online train reservation system.
3. Design the webpage using HTML and CSS.
4. Display available trains with train numbers, names, departure times, and ticket prices.
5. Allow users to enter source, destination, and journey date.
6. Display trains matching the selected route.
7. Accept passenger details and allow users to select the travel class.
8. Validate the passenger information and journey details.
9. Calculate the total ticket fare based on the selected class and number of passengers.
10. Generate a reservation ID and display the booking confirmation.
3. HTML CODE
Filename: experiment4_train.html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Train Reservation System</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="experiment4_train.css">
</head>
<body>

<header>
    <h1>🚆 RailConnect</h1>
    <p>Your Journey, Our Priority</p>
</header>

<nav>
    <a href="#search">Search Trains</a>
    <a href="#trains">Available Trains</a>
    <a href="#reservation">Reserve Tickets</a>
</nav>

<section class="hero">
    <h2>Book Your Train Journey</h2>
    <p>Explore routes, choose your class, and plan your journey.</p>
    <a href="#search" class="hero-button">Book Now</a>
</section>

<main>

    <section id="search" class="section">
        <h2>Search Your Train</h2>

        <form id="searchForm" class="search-form">
            <div>
                <label for="source">From</label>
                <input type="text" id="source"
                       placeholder="Source station" required>
            </div>

            <div>
                <label for="destination">To</label>
                <input type="text" id="destination"
                       placeholder="Destination station" required>
            </div>

            <div>
                <label for="journeyDate">Journey Date</label>
                <input type="date" id="journeyDate" required>
            </div>

            <button type="submit">Search Trains</button>
        </form>

        <p id="searchMessage" class="message"></p>
    </section>

    <section id="trains" class="section">
        <h2>Available Trains</h2>
        <p class="subtitle">Select a train for your journey.</p>

        <div id="trainList" class="train-container"></div>
    </section>

    <section id="reservation" class="section reservation-section">
        <h2>Passenger Reservation</h2>

        <form id="reservationForm">

            <div class="form-grid">

                <div>
                    <label for="selectedTrain">Select Train</label>
                    <select id="selectedTrain" required>
                        <option value="">Choose a train</option>
                        <option value="1">Chennai Express</option>
                        <option value="2">Bangalore Mail</option>
                        <option value="3">Hyderabad Superfast</option>
                    </select>
                </div>

                <div>
                    <label for="passengerName">Passenger Name</label>
                    <input type="text" id="passengerName"
                           placeholder="Enter full name" required>
                </div>

                <div>
                    <label for="age">Age</label>
                    <input type="number" id="age"
                           min="1" max="120" required>
                </div>

                <div>
                    <label for="gender">Gender</label>
                    <select id="gender" required>
                        <option value="">Select gender</option>
                        <option value="Female">Female</option>
                        <option value="Male">Male</option>
                        <option value="Other">Other</option>
                    </select>
                </div>

                <div>
                    <label for="phone">Mobile Number</label>
                    <input type="tel" id="phone"
                           pattern="[0-9]{10}"
                           placeholder="10-digit mobile number" required>
                </div>

                <div>
                    <label for="travelClass">Travel Class</label>
                    <select id="travelClass" required>
                        <option value="Sleeper">Sleeper Class</option>
                        <option value="AC3">AC 3 Tier</option>
                        <option value="AC2">AC 2 Tier</option>
                    </select>
                </div>

                <div>
                    <label for="passengers">Number of Passengers</label>
                    <input type="number" id="passengers"
                           min="1" max="6" value="1" required>
                </div>

            </div>

            <div class="fare-box">
                <p>Selected Train: <strong id="trainName">Not selected</strong></p>
                <p>Fare Per Passenger: <strong id="farePerPassenger">₹0</strong></p>
                <h3>Total Fare: <span id="totalFare">₹0</span></h3>
            </div>

            <button type="submit" class="confirm-button">
                Confirm Reservation
            </button>

        </form>

        <div id="reservationResult" class="reservation-result hidden"></div>
    </section>

</main>

<footer>
    <p>© 2026 RailConnect | Online Train Reservation System</p>
</footer>

<script src="experiment4_train.js"></script>

</body>
</html>

